# Files that should not be touched

## Context

`app/src/store.ts` (the dispatch/notify engine) and `app/src/types.ts` (the core
types + `Action` union) are load-bearing. Changing them ripples through the
whole app.

## Rule

- Never modify `app/src/store.ts` and `app/src/types.ts` unless the modification was explicitly approved

## How to verify

- no new changes in `app/src/store.ts` and `app/src/types.ts` unless such changes were approved
